# Changelog

## [1.0.0] - 2025-07-24

### Added

- Initial release of the Bharatavāṇi web app
- Sloka display with meanings, translations, and summaries
- Chapter 1 sloka data (in Telugu)
- Streamlit-based interface
- README and LICENSE files
- Team member section and roles

### Changed

- Improved Adhyaya scroll bar functionality
- Updated UI layout to fit dynamic text sizes

### Fixed

- Text overflow issues
- Removed unnecessary numbering from translations and summaries

### Future Plans

- Add a comment box for user interaction
- Include a like button to save favorite slokas
- Add audio support for sloka translations and summaries
